id=n770f_sysbta
name=N770F Bluetooth audio (sysbta, ColorOS port)
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=port
description=Bluetooth A2DP audio for the ColorOS port: TrebleDroid's system-side Bluetooth audio HAL (from the android_16.0.0_r1 TrebleDroid GSI) with an LD_PRELOAD shim so the provider registers as IBluetoothAudioProviderFactory/default, plus the sysbta module in the vendor audio policy. The Samsung vendor only has its own SEH Bluetooth audio HAL.
